=\"\"> <span>驱动核心</span></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table style=\"border-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1;font-size:16px;min-width:25px;border-collapse:collapse;\" class=\"\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\"><colgroup><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2024/03/22/50494840/b155b04e768e157e00e4871b3b1f74d0_5386706507259292567.gif\" href=\"\" style=\"border:none;vertical-align:middle;\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></li></ul> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">3.141593</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">同调(I&nbsp;/II&nbsp;/III)阶</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">武器技能全元素伤害提高<strong>(<span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">4.0%/8.0%/12.0%</span>)</strong>，物理伤害提高<strong>(<span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">3.0%/6.0%/9.0%</span>)</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">锻炼记忆力的咒语</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:0秒]</span></strong>武器主动技能的冷却时间、充能次数、技能效果由装备角色的类型决定</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">超越世界的常数</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">全伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">15.0%</span></strong>，<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>星环爆发</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;星环爆发&